<title>USA: Zale Corp names Lou Grabowsky new CFO.</title>
<headline>Zale Corp names Lou Grabowsky new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zale Corp said on Friday it hired Lou Grabowsky as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Grabowsky, who most recently was a partner at the Dallas/Fort Worth office of Arthur Andersen, will join Zale by March 31. He replaces Merrill Wertheimer, who is retiring.</p>
